/**
 * Which devices each design is actually sold for, read from the live
 * florayn.com catalogue.
 *
 * A product is one design in one case type, and its variants are devices. The
 * device list is NOT a property of the case type alone - it varies design by
 * design, so this is swept from the live store rather than derived from a
 * compatibility rule. Deriving it from case type alone produced 22,718
 * variants; the live catalogue has 13,041, so the rule invented roughly 9,700
 * device/product combinations that are not for sale.
 *
 * Generated by sweeping all 13,281 products through the public WooCommerce
 * Store API. Identical device lists are shared as named sets to keep this
 * readable - 60 distinct sets cover all 525 design/case-type pairs.
 *
 * A set id is only a name. Identical lists are shared, so a set named for one
 * construction may also be used by another that happens to fit the same
 * devices.
 *
 * Do not edit by hand; re-sweep instead.
 */

